# Dwarven Mattock: "attach it to target Dwarf you control" with no Dwarf to target does nothing, so the Mattock enters unattached and
# the Mattock gives nothing. Next turn a Dwarven Provisioner is cast and "Equip {3}" is paid with exactly three more mana
# (all five Moxen are spent, the pool empty after), making the 2/2 Dwarf a 4/4 with ward {1}. CR 702.6a, 301.5.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Dwarven Provisioner
Dwarven Mattock
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

